/.lake
.DS_Store

# Worked examples kept as models for our own use. The published repository should
# contain only results worth publishing on their own merits, not illustrations.
# See docs/examples/README.md.
/docs/examples/

# Private maintainer notes: release admin and personal preference, not something a
# user of the library needs. See MAINTAINING.local.md.
*.local.md

# Source papers kept locally for reference while formalising. Copyright is not ours
# to redistribute, so these must never reach the published repository.
/papers/

# Reviews of this library commissioned from outside it. Someone else's words about our
# work, kept locally so the findings can be acted on; not ours to publish, and not part
# of what the library ships.
/external_review/
